TOKEN tinybird_read READ

DESCRIPTION >
    Google Analytics Data API responses for the retired pollinations.ai GA4 property 277369924
    (tag G-LPZ9GEJVHR), copied by .github/workflows/data-export-ga-history-tinybird.yml before
    the old Google Workspace goes away. One row per dataset, calendar month and start_row, body
    as returned; ranges end two days before the run, once GA has processed them. Datasets:
    traffic (day, source, medium, campaign, country, device), hosts (day, site, country). No
    page paths. Every response of a run shares fetched_at; row_count is GA's total for the
    report, so the latest fetched_at per dataset and month is complete when its bodies hold
    row_count rows.

SCHEMA >
    `dataset` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.dataset`,
    `start_date` Date `json:$.start_date`,
    `end_date` Date `json:$.end_date`,
    `start_row` UInt32 `json:$.start_row`,
    `row_count` UInt32 `json:$.row_count`,
    `fetched_at` DateTime `json:$.fetched_at`,
    `body` String `json:$.body`

ENGINE "MergeTree"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "dataset, start_date, start_row, fetched_at"
